    "statement": "Xbox controller models: 1537 (launch, no 3.5 mm jack), 1697 (adds 3.5 mm jack and wireless firmware updates), 1708 (Xbox One S, adds Bluetooth), 1914 (Series X|S, USB-C, Share button).",
    "evidence": "Controller variations.",
    "quote": "",
    "at": ""
   },
   {
    "statement": "USB IDs: 1537 = 045E:02D1; 1697 = 045E:02DD; 1708 = 045E:02EA (USB), 02E0/02FD (BT), 0B20 (BLE); 1914 = 045E:0B12 (USB), 0B13 (BT). Wireless adapters 1713 = 045E:02E6, 1790 = 045E:02FE.",
    "evidence": "Technical information.",
    "quote": "",
    "at": ""
   },
   {
    "statement": "Only Model 1708 and later have Bluetooth; firmware updates need the Xbox Accessories app on Windows or a console.",
